---
description: "API routes and Server Actions for Next.js."
globs:
  - "app/api/**/*.ts"
  - "app/api/**/*.tsx"
  - "**/actions.ts"
  - "**/actions/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

When editing API or Server Actions:

- Keep handlers thin; move reusable logic to `lib/`.
- Validate body/query with Zod before use.
- Return typed JSON; prefer early returns for error paths.
- Never hardcode secrets; use validated env from `lib/env.ts`.
- Prefer Server Actions for form mutations when the UI is in the same app.
